      },
      "ThemeOverride": {
        "override_font_size": true,
        "font_size": 13
      },
      "Label": {
        "text": "Crates, balls, a capsule, a cylinder and a pyramid made convex from its .mesh fall on a floor; a ramp is a mesh collider, and the near side is shut by a collider with nothing drawn. The orange capsule is a CharacterBody3D: the arrows or WASD walk it, Space jumps, and it leans on what it walks into. Click a body to push it; click the red button to drop a crate. The yellow zone is an Area3D that lights while a body is in it, and the scanner is a RayCast3D going round."
      }
    },
